  "label": "Islamophobic Stereotypes",
  "description": "The meme relies on the harmful stereotype that Muslims, particularly those associated with the Quran, are inherently linked to terrorism or barbarism. This is a common Islamophobic trope used to dehumanize and fearmonger against Muslim communities. The image of boys studying the Quran is juxtaposed with this stereotype to imply that these boys are dangerous or incompatible with Western values, which is a direct attack on the Muslim community.",
